@title Super Mario Advance 3 - Yoshi's Island (USA)
@file Super Mario Advance 3 - Yoshi's Island (U) [!].gba
@game A3AE
@chip EEPROM
@status wip: stops at the first page of the stork story on FILE A (mashing A on from there drops Yoshi into 1-1, Make Eggs, Throw Eggs); the cart only gets its boot-time initialisation records until a stage is cleared, so the first save needs 1-1 played to the goal ring (the game saves on returning to the map). Holding RIGHT with flutter jumps stalls at the first tall hill, and enemy positions already differ between emulators at the stage start (the story is mashed through), so a human should record: Single Player, Yoshi's Island, FILE A, story, clear 1-1, back on the map after the save; [load] picks FILE A and shows the map with 1-1 cleared.

# Title -> Single Player -> Yoshi's Island -> FILE A -> story -> stage 1-1.

[new]
mash START until text "Single Player" timeout=1500 every=60
wait 30
checkpoint title_menu compare=text
press A after=90
until text "Choose a" timeout=600 every=10
wait 30
checkpoint choose_game compare=text
press A after=120
until text "Nintendo" timeout=1200 every=10
wait 30
checkpoint yi_title compare=text
press START after=120
until text "FILE MENU" timeout=600 every=10
until stable 20 timeout=300
checkpoint file_menu
press A after=180
until text "Welcome" timeout=1200 every=10
wait 20
checkpoint story window=10
